# Secrets hygiene (B8, testnet-readiness-review.md §2). These patterns catch
# any per-network .env / deployer key file added from here on, without a
# `git add -A` accidentally committing a funded private key.
#
# sandbox-local/.env was tracked until 2026-09-13 (it held a keyed mainnet RPC
# URL). It is untracked now and covered by */.env below; rotate any key that was
# ever committed. Copy sandbox-local/.env.example to start one.
*/.env
*/.env.*
!*/.env.example
*/deployer-account.json
**/.env.local

# Release tarballs are build output. devops make-release-tarball.sh writes them
# to <zeracle root>/dist/ since 2026-09-13; a committed one leaked the sandbox
# attestor key (readiness review S1).
*.tar.gz

# Regenerated on every local redeploy.
sandbox-local/public-manifest.json
